sde-fortran is a modern Fortran translation and adaptation of the R package
"sde: Simulation and Inference for Stochastic Differential Equations",
version 2.0.21, by Stefano Maria Iacus.

Upstream package metadata:
  Author: Stefano Maria Iacus
  License: GNU General Public License, version 2 or any later version
  Source package: sde 2.0.21

The supplied upstream C source states:
  Code of this package: Copyright (C) 2006 S. M. Iacus

This translation is a derivative work and is distributed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 or any later version. The complete GPL-2.0
text is in LICENSE. Copies of the upstream DESCRIPTION, NAMESPACE, NEWS, and
original C license header are retained in upstream/.

R expression parsing, ts/zoo/fda object infrastructure, plotting, and bundled
R data files are not reproduced. Their numerical functionality is represented
by typed arrays, procedure callbacks, direct kernels, or documented exclusions.
